%% Runtime state transitions
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> running: thread_create
  running --> running: checkpoint_save
  running --> awaiting_approval: interrupt
  awaiting_approval --> running: approve_or_revise
  awaiting_approval --> cancelled: reject
  running --> succeeded: complete
  running --> failed: error
  failed --> running: retry_from_checkpoint
  succeeded --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
